{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1364068-what-s-happening-at-deicon-in-the-world-of-scion","id":1364068,"title":"What's happening at Deicon (in The World of scion)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-29T16:58:59-08:00","id":1364068,"title":"What's happening at Deicon (in The World of scion)","content":"The Hero book mention of the Deifans (p. 32) is something that I have found very entertaining and fascinating.<br /> <br /> The idea of a very prolific and active community of fans of the gods writing their own stories, following intensely anything mythic related in the news is just great fodder for a scion game but also showcase well a facet of the integration of the mythical into everyday life.<br /> <br /> This lead me to the thought that where there are Deifans, then there must be a Deicon as well.<br /> <br /> So I'm wondering, what are the booths, conferences and contests one could find at \u201cthis year\u201d Deicon ?<br /> <br /> <br /> To start of with my own contribution.<br /> <br /> Relic Hunters Booth:<br /> <br /> Every year, one can find the booth of the Relic Hunting Academy (i need a better name). They are a grouping of students and teachers of various universities in the world that focus on cataloguing, studying and following relics in The World.<br /> <br /> At the booth one can purchase either the most recent copy of the Relic Hunting Magazine or subscribe to it. The magazine comes out every 4 months and provide lots of informations on relics currently in The World.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T09:12:05-07:00","id":1405592,"title":"","content":"I like to imagine vendor booths that have light-up toy versions of various well-known Scions' weapons and armor. Get your own replica Giantsbane today!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","name":"yukikaze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T09:47:24-07:00","id":1405594,"title":"","content":"- Storytelling competitions in which Deifans recount the most recent Deeds of their favourite Scions in the style of traditional epics, poetry, song, or dance<br /> <br /> - Expert panels: &quot;Omens and How to Spot Them,&quot; &quot;Dedication vs. Stalking: Being a Respectful Deifan,&quot; &quot;Top Mistakes in This Year's God-themed Movies,&quot; &quot;No Cold Iron: Providing Safe Environments for Denizens&quot;<br /> <br /> - Informational booths that are thinly-veiled recruitment stations for a variety of Cults<br /> <br /> - &quot;Spot the Shapeshifter,&quot; a Deicon-wide game in which one attendee is designated as this year's shapeshifter, and carries subtle tokens to reveal their nature (e.g., a foxtail design on some clothing). The shapeshifter wins the event by remaining undetected for the duration of the con. (Despite persistent rumours, the player is almost never an actual shapeshifter. Almost never.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br