dited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T11:42:51-07:00","id":1405637,"title":"","content":"Late night raves and dances attempting to please party Gods.<br /> <br /> A rap battle hosted by the Tuatha<br /> <br /> Charity drives for the Teotl, where people drop off sacrifices dear to them","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24323-zipdrive","name":"ZipDrive","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T12:12:23-07:00","id":1405645,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZipDrive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1364068-what-s-happening-at-deicon-in-the-world-of-scion?p=1405637#post1405637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Late night raves and dances attempting to please party Gods.<br /> <br /> A rap battle hosted by the Tuatha<br /> <br /> Charity drives for the Teotl, where people drop off sacrifices dear to them</div> </div> </div> </div>EPIC RAP BATTLES OF MYTHOLOGY!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","name":"yukikaze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T15:25:26-07:00","id":1405676,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s funny, my view of a Deicon is less ComicCon and more RifleCon.<br /> <br /> Relic hunters would be more mercs (sweaty people venturing in dangerous dark dirty places) than deifans (people hoping to get treasures without risking their lives). They would offer guided visits to well known places and maybe some more expensive trips to less known places they had already been.<br /> People would not cosplay as gods or heroes (that is the kind of thing that got cities destroyed back then), but there would be some theater plays on the con telling the stories of myths (with proper respect to the gods).<br /> Fanfics would not be a thing (the real story is far more interesting), but the poetry/ rap/ music contests would be awesome.<br /> Heroes showing up and giving autographs, giving tips on how to get heroic muscles, showing some prizes (some of them as monster body parts), telling stories about how the Terra incognita adventures went, making tributes for the lost heroes.<br /> For sure there would be a some kiosks selling some low power relics with maybe one good relic behind a glass with a tag with too many digits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 07-31-2020, 08:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T15:31:34-07:00","id":1405677,"title":"","content":"Also the reality shows would be awesome:<br /> <br /> Imagine one of those naked / primitive surviving reality shows, but with heroes In different Terra incognita.<br /> Or a show about the border control to the underworld where they check if the bags have anything that should not be in the other side (applies both ways) and arrest people that were carrying underworld food or their living belongings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://foru