c hunters would be more mercs (sweaty people venturing in dangerous dark dirty places) than deifans (people hoping to get treasures without risking their lives). They would offer guided visits to well known places and maybe some more expensive trips to less known places they had already been.<br /> People would not cosplay as gods or heroes (that is the kind of thing that got cities destroyed back then), but there would be some theater plays on the con telling the stories of myths (with proper respect to the gods).<br /> Fanfics would not be a thing (the real story is far more interesting), but the poetry/ rap/ music contests would be awesome.<br /> Heroes showing up and giving autographs, giving tips on how to get heroic muscles, showing some prizes (some of them as monster body parts), telling stories about how the Terra incognita adventures went, making tributes for the lost heroes.<br /> For sure there would be a some kiosks selling some low power relics with maybe one good relic behind a glass with a tag with too many digits.</div> </div> </div> </div>My idea of Deicon is more like ComiCon, but yours is pretty cool too \ud83d\ude0a.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-02T08:26:57-07:00","id":1405948,"title":"","content":"Been thinking on the presence of Heroes in Deicon.<br /> While i think there is a fair bit of scion at the Origin presence (those that know of their divine heritage probably lead panels on their life experiences and such) i think that common wisdom is that there are few if any Hero tier scions at Deicon.<br /> While fatebinding isnt as harsh for Heroes i think its a bit dangerous to put yourself in close proximity to people who would be obsessed with getting fatebound.<br /> <br /> That said, thats only common wisdom, in truth there is a surprising number of Heroes who attend incognito and the 'Con is a good opportunity to meet and connect with other Heroes.<br /> There is a pervasive rumor of Heroes only events and after parties that people are desperatly trying to find.<br /> <br /> A Demigod officially attending is probably the event of the century.<br /> <br /> While in my games Gods son't involve themselves directly in the World as their god tiered power (thats what scions are for after all), it wouldnt be surprinsing for some gods to have a mortal tier incarnate going there to have fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-02T08:57:08-07:00","id":1405953,"title":"","content":"I don't think fate binding is a thing people talk about, even heroes may have little knowledge of how it works. Some if not most of the players (including myself) have a vague idea of how the game rules work, imagine the rules of Fate in world...<br /> <br /> Demigods sure are not going to be around, but I think the Heroes are famous enough to have fans and frequent inviting to Deicons. On Hero level, Legend brings fame, and Fame on modern world means be on the TV/Internet all the time, even against their own will. So, probably showing up on a Con is not as out of contest as it may sound.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 08-02-2020, 12:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-02T09:13:36-07:00","id":1405954,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Mateus Luz;n1405953]I don't think fate binding is a thing people talk about, even heroes may have little knowledge of how it works. ....]<br /> <br /> Oh definitely, i used the term fatebinding as a shortcut.<br /> While mortal may not understand the existence of fatebinding, they do have enough pattern recognition to see that mortals , in certain not understood circumstances, ... enter the Legend of Heroes.<br /> And there would definitely be a subset of Deifans who wants that for them.<br /> <br /> But yeah, i always struggle to understand mechanics and their in-universe perception.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-02T10:59:15-07:00","id":1405964,"title":"","content":"Yeah, while Fatebinding as a mechanical term probably doesn't exist in the game, I wager that in-universe people are able to recognize that sometimes when a Hero is around, mortals can get caught up in their bullshit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-02T11:09:17-07:00","id":1405968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1364068-what-s-happening-at-deicon-in-the-world-of-scion?p=1405964#post1405964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, while Fatebinding as a mechanical term probably doesn't exist in the game, I wager that in-universe people are able to recognize that sometimes when a Hero is around, mortals can get caught up in their bullshit.</div> </div> </div> </div>That makes sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-02T13:30:51-07:00","id":1405986,"title":"","content":"Het Kyman201, it doesn't even require BS. Consider the real world term &quot;Jonah.&quot; It reflects an idea that some power...the will of a deity... remorseless fate...scary levels of bad luck... whatever, will cause those around a hero with a dark fate or dangerous destiny to get caught in the undertow.<br /> <br /> If I am a Hero and my dark fate is to be the sole survivor of seven shipwrecks, and futher I am cursed with an overwhelming compulsion to travel the sea, plus a curse that if I don't travel the sea all those people, creatures, or things I love will whither and fade. I'll be miserable and everyone would do well to avoid me. If humanly possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 08-02-2020, 04:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T00:01:54-07:00","id":1406070,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hi this is Irene, manager of Herowatch PNW chapter, I'm here at the thirty-fifth annual DeiCon in New York! So first we're going to hit the Artist Alley to see if I can find any art of some of my Up And Comers list. We'll be taking stock of costumes, of course, hit the dealer's hall and see if we can find any good stuff, and there'll even be a panel later about <i>What to do if you find yourself caught up in a Hero's Shenanigans</i> featuring, well, yours truly! We got three days, a fanny pack full of snacks, and a belt of water bottles, LET'S DO THIS!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T11:19:46-07:00","id":1406127,"title":"","content":"The fanfic panels must be wild...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","name":"yukikaze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T11:42:08-07:00","id":1406129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>yukikaze</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1364068-what-s-happening-at-deicon-in-the-world-of-scion?p=1406127#post1406127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Vi