</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1364068-what-s-happening-at-deicon-in-the-world-of-scion?p=1406127#post1406127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The fanfic panels must be wild...</div> </div> </div> </div>They also might be banned after the first Deicon where fanfic writers inadvertently caused fatebindings on/with gods, and the gods called in their lawyers to shut that right down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T13:29:50-07:00","id":1406141,"title":"","content":"Various booths offer teaching actual sorcery.<br /> <br /> On the Scholomance brochure.<br /> <br /> Welcome to Scholomance!!!<br /> Where you can :<br /> - learn the intricacies of Magic<br /> - cast deadly curses on your enemies<br /> - learn the actual fireball spell you always wanted to cast<br /> - and maybe even, get chosen by the Devil as an apprentice !!! Wow<br /> <br /> Don't hesitate and apply now.<br /> Ultimate power is just at your fingertip<br /> <br /> <br /> *Warning, the safety of your soul is not guaranteed*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":11312,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","user":"Maitrecorbo","date":". 08-03-2020, 07:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/